      "widgets_values": ["=== FLUX SCHNELL Q4 GGUF → HIGH RES 9:16 WORKFLOW ===\n\nSTAGE 1: Base generation 576x1024 (9:16)\n  - Steps: 6, CFG: 1.0, Sampler: euler/simple\n  - Schnell needs LOW steps + CFG=1.0 (it's distilled!)\n\nSTAGE 2: img2img refine at 1152x2048\n  - Steps: 8, Denoise: 0.5 (keeps structure, adds detail)\n  - Same model, same prompt\n\nSTAGE 3: 4x UltraSharp upscale → ~4608x8192 (4K+)\n\n=== REQUIRED FILES ===\nmodels/unet/          → flux1-schnell-Q4_K_M.gguf\nmodels/clip/          → t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors\n                      → clip_l.safetensors\nmodels/vae/           → ae.safetensors\nmodels/upscale_models/→ 4x-UltraSharp.pth\n\n=== REQUIRED NODES ===\ncomfyui-gguf (pip: comfyui-gguf)\n\n=== PYTHON PIPELINE ===\nDo NOT set SHORTS_COMFY_WORKFLOW_NAME to this file.\nThis JSON is ComfyUI UI format (nodes/links). The app needs API format:\nworkflows/flux_schnell_local.json (Save API Format or use that file as-is)."]
